= The Right: advisers

The Right is the party of the districts and the unions: Thalheimer who thinks, Walcher who knows the factories, Radek who speaks for Moscow, Heckert who sits in the Saxon government. Each can act once every three months. A faction that is not consulted for six months while it still has real strength grows angry.

- @thalheimer
- @walcher
